    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u><strong>About the Game:</strong></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day of Invasion Reloaded is the Finished and Cleaned up Version of the 2017 released beta &quot;Day of Invasion 1&quot; made with Game Guru.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Reloaded Version features new weapons, enhanced UI, Enhanced Sound Design and a new Soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u><strong>Story:</strong></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Day of Invasion, you find yourself in a dark and dangerous world where humanity is on the brink of extinction, after a viral breakout occurred in the local Facilities of Horton Genetics. Your journey begins in the abandoned village of Balthon, once a busy place, now overrun by bloodthirsty Infected. Your goal: the distant Milespring City, the last glimmer of hope for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Your way, you will find a large variety of Weapons, that will help you to fight your way through the dangerous Valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gameplay:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day of Invasion: Reloaded is a First Person Zombie Shooter with simple combat mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game takes roughly around 20 minutes to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Dev Note:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day of Invasion was the First game we ever made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We initially wanted to release it on steam via Steam Greenlight back in 2017, but it got rejected. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, 7 years later, we gave it a polish and finally put it up here in order to add another perspective to the story of the Horton Genetics Disaster.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u><strong>About the Game:</strong></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day of Invasion Reloaded is the Finished and Cleaned up Version of the 2017 released beta &quot;Day of Invasion 1&quot; made with Game Guru.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Reloaded Version features new weapons, enhanced UI, Enhanced Sound Design and a new Soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u><strong>Story:</strong></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Day of Invasion, you find yourself in a dark and dangerous world where humanity is on the brink of extinction, after a viral breakout occurred in the local Facilities of Horton Genetics. Your journey begins in the abandoned village of Balthon, once a busy place, now overrun by bloodthirsty Infected. Your goal: the distant Milespring City, the last glimmer of hope for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Your way, you will find a large variety of Weapons, that will help you to fight your way through the dangerous Valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gameplay:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day of Invasion: Reloaded is a First Person Zombie Shooter with simple combat mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game takes roughly around 20 minutes to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Dev Note:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day of Invasion was the First game we ever made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We initially wanted to release it on steam via Steam Greenlight back in 2017, but it got rejected. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, 7 years later, we gave it a polish and finally put it up here in order to add another perspective to the story of the Horton Genetics Disaster.</p>",
    "short_description": "Day of Invasion: Reloaded is a First Person Zombie-Shooter that takes place within the Horton-Genetics Disaster of Milespring. Find Weapons to fight your way through hordes of Infected!",
